{"ID":"20240515131349-uzshyn9","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131349-uzshyn9","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131349-uzshyn9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142749-cf0ptaa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142749-cf0ptaa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:806,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515142749-cf0ptaa\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:833,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:833\u0026#125;","title":"098","type":"doc","updated":"20240515182539"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515142749-cf0ptaa","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 959px;","id":"20240515142749-cf0ptaa","updated":"20240515182539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/08/06"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"WM"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58，身材中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/06"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.因前一陣子檢查子宮有發現異常細胞，西醫欲切片進一步確定。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.睡眠一直不好，曾以中藥治療後有改善。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.易嘔吐，且暈眩嚴重。（幾個月發生一次嚴重暈眩，嘔吐後改善）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.大便時見清穀（裡寒）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.右肋時痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.記憶力差。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.頻尿，且小便無力。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.口苦。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.口渴，喜溫飲，飲多。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.頭面惡風、發麻，左臉也麻、惡風。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.右眼易流淚。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.正常出汗。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.雙足易冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.已停經2年。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈沈無力。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅，兩側齒痕。（病患自述晨起白苔）"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右瞳孔見光後略縮小隨即又擴大，肝區無正常紋路、較平整。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"特殊診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小腿膽點有壓痛→膽結石。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳穴膽點有壓痛→膽結石。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"右腎功能仍差（病患過去有此病史）、雙肩足少陽經循行處疼痛、膽結石。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙合谷、百會、左地倉透頰車、雙太陽、雙太衝、雙曲池（合谷太衝開四關導引氣機，其餘穴位處理頭面問題）、"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雙足三里、右膽石點（膽結石）、雙睛明（流淚）。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黃連二錢 黃芩三錢 白芍五錢 阿膠三錢（分三包）炮附五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乾薑二錢 吳茱萸三錢 白朮三錢 烏藥五錢 細辛二錢 黃耆五錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝五錢 炙甘草三錢 大棗十枚 生薑三片 柴胡三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實三錢 五倍子三錢 海金砂三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10帖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9碗煮成3碗，早晚餐前各服一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-14治膽結石方，2罐六兩。早晚餐後各服40粒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大黃三片，每日一片，泡熱水喝。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.本病患為華人婦女，身形中等略瘦，自述經常因自我要求高但做不到而很不開心、焦慮。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.故處方中以黃連阿膠湯處理睡眠問題（無失神故不加蛋黃），炮附乾薑溫中固表，吳茱萸止嘔，烏藥細辛治療頻尿，另合桂枝湯調和營衛治療惡風，四逆散加五倍子、海金砂治療膽結石。去膽結石從大便出，用白朮去濕不用茯苓以免造成濕自小便出，處方的方義是希望濕自大便出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.右眼易流淚乃濕熱所致，以大黃泡熱水取其氣，治療目部濕熱。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.膽結石平時可多吃酸味食物，如醋。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}